      "id": "56498de5c284-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "A statement is given followed by two conclusions. Find which conclusion is TRUE based on the given statement. Statement: C= A &le; T < D &ge; O; G &ge; D < S; T &ge; A Conclusions: I: A < O II: C < G",
      "questionHtml": "<p>A statement is given followed by two conclusions. Find which conclusion is TRUE based on the given statement.<br />\nStatement:<br />\nC= A &le; T &lt; D &ge; O; G &ge; D &lt; S; T &ge; A<br />\nConclusions:<br />\nI: A &lt; O<br />\nII: C &lt; G</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only II",
          "html": "Only II"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only I",
          "html": "Only I"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Either I or II",
          "html": "Either I or II"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II",
          "html": "Neither I nor II"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2;\">I: A < O - False <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(As, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">A ≤ T < D ≥ O, there is no direct relationship between A and O)</span><br />\nII: C < G - True (C= A ≤ T < D ≤ G, it gives C < G)</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2;\">Thus, only Conclusion II follows.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
