      "id": "56498de5c284-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows. Statement: The bank has introduced a biometric login system. Conclusions: I. The bank wants to improve security. II. Customers must carry biometric IDs.",
      "questionHtml": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows.<br />\nStatement: The bank has introduced a biometric login system.<br />\nConclusions:<br />\nI. The bank wants to improve security.<br />\nII. Customers must carry biometric IDs.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only Conclusion I follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only Conclusion II follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. The bank wants to improve security. - </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">True</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> (Because b</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">iometric login systems are generally introduced to enhance security and reduce fraud. So it is reasonable to conclude that the bank’s intention is to improve security).</span><br />\n<br style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" />\n<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Customers must carry biometric IDs. - False (Because b</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">iometric login usually uses fingerprints, face recognition, etc. — it does not necessarily require customers to carry separate biometric IDs).</span></p>\n\n<p>So, only Conclusion I follows.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
